Event ID

EV-011

Date

2016-06-17

Event Name

Serangan The DAO (Eksploit Reentrancy)

Event Type

Security

Description

Kontrak The DAO (inekubator dana terdesentralisasi) dieksploitasi melalui kerentanan reentrancy; ~3,6 juta ETH (~$50 juta saat itu) disedot ke child DAO penyerang.

Participants

The DAO (Slock.it), penyerang tidak diketahui, komunitas Ethereum, Ethereum Foundation

Location

On-chain (kontrak The DAO: 0xbb9bc244d798123fde783fcc1c72d3bb8c189413)

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

Krisis kepercayaan besar; perdebatan komunitas keras tentang immutable vs intervensi; memicu hard fork kontroversial.

Sources

https://www.coindesk.com/learn/2016/06/25/understanding-the-dao-attack/
https://blog.ethereum.org/2016/06/17/critical-update-re-dao-vulnerability

