Event ID

EV-013

Date

2016-10-18

Event Name

Hard Fork Tanger Whistle (Blok 2.463.000) - Anti-DoS

Event Type

Technology

Description

Hard fork darurat untuk meningkatkan biaya operasi IO-heavy (EXCODECOPY, BALANCE, CALL) dan membersihkan state bloat akibat serangan DoS berulang (Shanghai attacks).

Participants

Ethereum Foundation, Vitalik Buterin, tim klien, penambang

Location

Global (jaringan P2P)

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

Serangan DoS dihentikan; jaringan stabil kembali; biaya gas disesuaikan untuk operasi state-access.

Sources

https://blog.ethereum.org/2016/10/18/faq-upcoming-ethereum-hard-fork
https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-150

---

Event ID

EV-014

Date

2016-11-22

Event Name

Hard Fork Spurious Dragon (Blok 2.675.000) - Pembersihan State

Event Type

Technology

Description

Hard fork kedua anti-DoS: menghapus ~20 juta akun kosong (state clearing), menambah proteksi replay attack (EIP-155), mengurangi refund SSTORE (EIP-158).

Participants

Ethereum Foundation, Vitalik Buterin, tim klien

Location

Global (jaringan P2P)

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

Ukuran state dikurangi signifikan; perlindungan replay attack lintas chain; fondasi untuk pertumbuhan 2017.

Sources

https://blog.ethereum.org/2016/11/18/hard-fork-no-4-spurious-dragon
https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-155

