Event ID

EV-017

Date

2019-02-28

Event Name

Hard Fork Constantinople (Blok 7.280.000) - Bagian Metropolis 2

Event Type

Technology

Description

Constantinople (direncanakan Januari, ditunda karena bug reentrancy EIP-1283): EIP-145 (bitwise shifting), EIP-1014 (CREATE2), EIP-1052 (EXTCODEHASH), EIP-1234 (block reward 3→2 ETH, delay ice age 12 bulan).

Participants

Ethereum Foundation, Vitalik Buterin, tim klien (Geth, Parity, dll.), penambang

Location

Global (jaringan P2P)

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

CREATE2 memungkinkan counterfactual deployment; penurunan inflasi; fondasi untuk state channels dan L2.

Sources

https://blog.ethereum.org/2019/02/22/ethereum-constantinople-hard-fork
https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-1013

