Event ID

EV-026

Date

2022-09-15

Event Name

The Merge (Paris) - Transisi Proof-of-Work ke Proof-of-Stake

Event Type

Technology

Description

Execution layer (Paris) dipicu oleh Total Terminal Difficulty (TTD 58750000000000000000000) pada blok 15.537.393; Ethereum beralih sepenuhnya ke Proof-of-Stake; penghentian penambangan PoW; pengurangan emisi ETH ~90% (~0,5%/tahun inflasi netto).

Participants

Ethereum Foundation, Tim Beiko, Danny Ryan, Vitalik Buterin, tim klien eksekusi & konsensus, seluruh jaringan validator, penambang, komunitas

Location

Global (Mainnet Ethereum)

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

Konsensus PoS final; emisi ETH drastis turun; keamanan ekonomi berbasis staking; fondasi untuk sharding/withdrawals.

Sources

https://blog.ethereum.org/2022/09/15/the-merge-is-done
https://ethereum.org/en/upgrades/merge/
https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-3675

