Event ID

EV-027

Date

2023-04-12

Event Name

Upgrade Shanghai/Capella (Blok 17.034.870 / Epoch 194.048) - Penarikan Staking

Event Type

Technology

Description

Shanghai (execution) + Capella (consensus): EIP-3675 (withdrawal credentials 0x01), EIP-3855 (PUSH0), EIP-3860 (limit initcode), EIP-4895 (system-level withdrawal), EIP-6049 (deprecate SELFDESTRUCT). Memungkinkan penarikan ETH staked (partial & full).

Participants

Ethereum Foundation, Tim Beiko, Danny Ryan, tim klien, validator

Location

Mainnet Ethereum (Execution + Consensus Layer)

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

>18 juta ETH dapat ditarik; likuiditas staking terwujud; munculnya Liquid Staking Tokens (stETH, rETH) dominan.

Sources

https://blog.ethereum.org/2023/03/28/shanghai-announcement
https://eips.ethereum.org/EIPS/eip-4895

