Event ID

EV-028

Date

2024-03-13

Event Name

Upgrade Dencun (Cancun/Deneb) - Blok 19.426.587 / Epoch 269.568 - Proto-Danksharding

Event Type

Technology

Description

Dencun: EIP-4844 (blob transactions / proto-danksharding), EIP-1153 (transient storage), EIP-4788 (beacon block root di EVM), EIP-5656 (MCOPY), EIP-6780 (SELFDESTRUCT only same tx). Blob space mengurangi biaya L2 >90%.

Participants

Ethereum Foundation, Tim Beiko, Vitalik Buterin, Dankrad Feist, Justin Drake, tim klien, operator L2 (Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, zkSync, dll.)

Location

Mainnet Ethereum (Execution + Consensus Layer)

Status

Completed

Immediate Result

Biaya transaksi L2 turun drastis; throughput data ~1-2 MB/slot; fondasi untuk full Danksharding (Danksharding roadmap).

Sources

https://blog.ethereum.org/2024/03/13/dencun-announcement
